From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AdrielOrihuela <adriel.orihuela.m@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:02:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Restore the locator bar under regionised threading

Folia emptied out trackWaypoint, addPlayer, updatePlayer and removePlayer
and left the /waypoint command unregistered, which is why
/gamerule locator_bar does nothing on it. All of it is put back, routed
through RegionisedWaypoints so that neither direction reaches across a
region boundary.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

