+// LegacyFolia start - regionised locator bar
+// Upstream drives the locator bar by reaching from whichever thread moved something into every
+// other player it should be shown to, which under regionised threading is a data race with a real
+// crash in it. Folia's answer was to empty these methods out, which is why /gamerule locator_bar
+// does nothing on it.
+//
+// Everything here now delegates to RegionisedWaypoints, where the two directions are separated so
+// that each runs on the thread that already owns the state it touches. Nothing is read across a
+// region boundary.
